## loom SDLC (OpenCode)

This project uses the loom SDLC framework via the OpenCode harness. Available delivery
tiers:

{{STAGE_SKILL_LIST}}

- Quick path: `.opencode/commands/*.md` (fast, combo of skills + preset model; run with `/name`).
- Deep path: `.opencode/agents/*.md` primary agents (full workflow discipline for a stage;
  `Tab`-select them).
- Utility subagents: `.opencode/agents/*.md` with `mode: subagent` (dispatched via `@mention`).
- Granular skills live at `.opencode/skills/<slug>/SKILL.md`.
- **Handoffs:** context crosses stage seams through the on-disk ledger at
  `.loom/handoffs/` (**gitignored by default** — ephemeral coordination, not version-controlled) —
  see `.loom/handoffs/protocol.md` (a committed file, also listed in `opencode.json`'s
  `instructions:`). Produce a seam artifact at a stage exit; discover it at the next stage's entry.

See `wiki/adr/adr-014-loom-opencode-setup.md` in the loom repo for why this is shaped this
way, if this project vendors loom's wiki; otherwise this section is self-contained.
